<title>CHINA: China Jan-Aug alumina output up 16.53 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Aug alumina output up 16.53 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's alumina output totalled 1.6471 million tonnes in the first eight months of 1996, up by 16.53 percent compared with the same period last year, the State Statistical Bureau said on Monday.</p>
<p>Alumina production in August alone was 208,600 tonnes, it said.</p>
</text>
